  [context](authored/source-context.json) and [excerpts](authored/source-excerpts.json).

All noun/adjective/verb/adverb frames match the frozen subclasses. Person nouns
remain nouns rather than participles. Gender restrictions, nominal IPA and
excluded meanings are explicit. `tsar` is contemporary vocabulary for a
historical title. `manche` selects the sleeve, `chèvre` the female animal and
`batterie` connected rechargeable accumulators. `homicide` does not imply
intentional murder. The golf definition retains the modern sport without the
source’s two-camp condition. CFC cartographic text in `marge` and `grain` is excluded.

