| --- | --- |
| `uv run --python 3.14.10 python -B -X utf8 scripts/test_core_batch_147.py` | Passed: 3 resource/admission tests |
| Archived `reproduce.py` with the same Python flags | Passed: 12 outputs identical byte for byte, offline |
